  "audit_notes": [
    "51 model/effort records audited on 2026-10-28. GPT-5.6 Terra historical benchmark values retained with prior check date; successor GPT-6.1 Terra replaces it in the representative chart.",
    "Gemini 3.8 Flash medium/high costs now USD 2.59/3.49; Grok 4.7 low/high/xhigh costs now USD 1.03/2.36/3.24; Argon high now USD 1.62. Other audited prior values unchanged.",
    "Six Terra variants: five reasoning efforts on main chart; non-reasoning CSV only, selectable Copilot configuration unverified.",
    "GitHub support table contains 28 names, including Grok 4.5 despite the explicit Oct 19 retirement announcement. Retire it per dated announcement; preserve conflict here.",
    "GPT-5.6 Terra retirement recommendation is GPT-6.1 Sol or GPT-6 Luna (Oct 15 announcement). Direct same-product successor GPT-6.1 Terra was introduced later on Oct 26; preserve the two fields separately.",
    "Claude Opus 4.8 has an annual individual-plan retirement exception after Nov 16; fast-mode coverage is not explicit in the notice, so no retirement inferred for fast mode.",
